# Independent dated resource evidence

Supercell’s [4 April 2022 balance notes](https://supercell.com/en/games/clashroyale/blog/release-notes/balance-changes-april-2022/) state that the changes were live: the comparison resource building’s duration became65seconds, generation interval became9seconds, and destruction addedone resource. The publisher also states that total lifetime production stayed8.

These independently corroborate the pinned9000ms/65000ms/death1 fields. They do not specify cadenceanchor, reset, capacity, exactrecipient, orsame-tick/expiryordering. Those consumer details remainQUESTION. At60ticks/s the durations convert to540/3900ticks; the currentlocalQ510/4200 estimates differ. No referencecorpus confidence flag orruntime was changed here.

Accessed2026-10-15 viaweb search, official datedpublisher page. The rarity labeluncommon is the project’s intentionalalias forRare, proved bytests/cards-basic-melee.test.js; it is not a source mismatch.
